  "term": "lacunar stroke",
  "definition": "Lacunar stroke is a type of stroke discussed here in the context of cerebral microangiopathy. In patients with acute lacunar stroke, brain changes such as leukoaraiosis and cerebral microbleeds commonly occur together.",
